     *       the group size is at least the vehicle capacity.</li>
     * </ul>
     *
     * <p>After handling solo trips, the remaining items are sorted in descending
     * order and groups are formed starting with the heaviest available item.
     * This greedy strategy maximizes the number of trips.
     *
     * @param weights  List of item weights (may be {@code null} or empty).
     * @param capacity Vehicle capacity (must be positive).
     * @return Maximum number of trips that can be made.
     */
    public static int calculateMaxTrips(ArrayList<Integer> weights, int capacity) {
